# Change Log
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
 
The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](http://keepachangelog.com/)
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/)

##0.0.2 - 2025-05-03
### Added
- Counting the number of skipped ranges (skippedCount).
- Entry in skipped_XX.log at the end of the job: how many ranges were skipped.
- Country code length check.
- Clean (not append) output file.
- Count IP addresses.
- Protection against overly large ranges.
- Improved code readability.
- Workers read IP ranges and convert them to strings.
- One separate worker writes to a file to avoid write conflicts.
- Management via WaitGroup to ensure all goroutines terminate gracefully.
- IPV6


##0.0.1 - 2021-04-23
### Added
- Release.